Cele-Tweaks integrates optionally with other mods (Litematica, Tweakeroo,
TweakerMore, Syncmatica, Item Scroller, Mod Menu) by referring to their public
class and method names at runtime. No source code from those mods, or from any
other third-party project, is included in this repository or in its builds.
